{"unit_id":"shaoeric__dsh-suggest#card-zh","repo":"shaoeric/dsh-suggest","commit":"ccbc98aefc0b69ad5d260c4e18e359659602a6bd","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-suggest 是面向 DSH web 客户端的对话辅助插件，会在助手回答下方生成三条后续问题建议。它通过 turnTail 插槽展示建议，并由 host 端读取会话片段、调用当前会话模型生成问题；优先尝试同 provider 的 flash 模型。用户可以点击建议直接发送，也可以先填入输入框编辑；失败时可查看原因并重试。建议只显示在最新一轮回答下，生成结果带有缓存和并发去重。适合希望快速继续对话、减少手动组织追问的 DSH web 用户。需要 DSH 提供会话与 LLM 服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:242-311","lib/index.js:314-340","lib/client.js:87-113","lib/client.js:117-125","lib/client.js:216-234"]}
{"unit_id":"shaoeric__dsh-suggest#card-en","repo":"shaoeric/dsh-suggest","commit":"ccbc98aefc0b69ad5d260c4e18e359659602a6bd","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-suggest adds three follow-up questions below DSH web answers, generated from recent conversation text by the session model. Users can send a suggestion or edit it first. Errors can be retried, and older turns hide their suggestions. Requires DSH session and LLM services.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:242-311","lib/index.js:314-340","lib/client.js:87-113","lib/client.js:117-125","lib/client.js:216-234"]}
